@startuml sequence-network
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true
actor 用户 as U
participant "BackupFrame\n(Network 页)" as UI
participant "NetworkBackupService" as SVC
participant "NetworkBackupClient" as CLI
participant "NetworkBackupServer" as SRV
participant "NetworkUsers" as USR
participant "BackupCatalog" as CAT

== 服务器启动（同一台或局域网另一台机器） ==
U -> UI : Start server(存储目录, 端口)
UI -> SRV : start(port, storageRoot)
SRV -> SRV : 首次启动 keytool 自签证书\n(SAN: localhost/127.0.0.1)
SRV -> SRV : 清扫残留 .incoming-*.part
UI -> USR : ensureUser(用户名, 口令)
USR -> USR : PBKDF2(210000) → 仅存盐值+验证值

== 网络备份 ==
U -> UI : Back up to server
UI -> CLI : new（信任服务器密钥库文件）
UI -> SVC : backup(client, options, keepGroups)
SVC -> CLI : listSnapshots()
CLI -> SRV : GET /api/snapshots (Basic 认证 over TLS)
SRV --> CLI : Properties 快照列表
SVC -> CLI : fetchManifest(最新归档名)
CLI -> SRV : GET /api/manifest
SRV --> CLI : 清单全文（增量基线）
SVC -> SVC : 增量判定（与本地同规则）\n扫描 → 与基线比对 → 变化条目
SVC -> SVC : 本地写归档（可选加密）
SVC -> CLI : upload(归档)
CLI -> SRV : POST /api/upload（流式）
SRV -> SRV : 暂存 .incoming-<uuid>.part → 返回 token
SVC -> CLI : commit(token, 清单, keepGroups)
CLI -> SRV : POST /api/commit
SRV -> SRV : 校验清单/归档名 → ATOMIC_MOVE 发布\n写清单旁挂 + 快照索引 + 最新清单
SRV -> CAT : prune(users/<账号>, taskId, keepGroups)
SRV --> CLI : stored + 警告
SVC --> UI : NetworkBackupResult
UI -> GATE : complete()

== 网络还原 ==
U -> UI : List snapshots → Restore selected
UI -> CLI : download(归档名)
CLI -> SRV : GET /api/download
SRV --> CLI : 归档字节流
UI -> SVC : restore(client, 归档名, 目标, 口令)
SVC -> SVC : 调用本地 BackupService.restoreDetailed\n（安全/元数据语义与本地完全一致）
SVC --> UI : RestoreResult
@enduml
